# I03.var08 prospective contract v1 metadata NO_GO

The first authored design JSON, SHA-256 `a9ad55703a87178751e22ed0b1bef0cba3566699a401d3201fc431909e41a9f2`, and generator, SHA-256 `a3a44cef8829561a8cd170d562d016d90b27b06a3ffe422b32cc73f5d6a5547d`, remain unchanged.

Read-only comparison with accepted `I03-var02-idle-crew-out-v1.0.2/native-input.json` found two prospective source-schema gaps: ResourceTransfer columns STFID, STTID, RID and TFTIME have `key:true`; the accepted I03 authored table order places ResourceTransfer after ResourceAllocation and before MaterielPM. V1 omitted the four key flags and described the added table only as appended. A distinct v2 will pin both details. No child input, package, preflight or native run was created from v1.
